## Hard rules

- No secrets in git (`.env`, keys, vault material)  
- IaC for hosts lives under `hosts/` — prefer declared state over one-off shell  
- Product code in `products/` or `services/`, not `lab/` until promoted  
- Prefer tests for behavior changes at monorepo or package level  
